cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pain001-sdk-go in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pain001-sdk-go: a typed Go client for the pain001 REST API"
abstract: >-
  A Go client for the pain001 REST API, which validates payment files
  and generates ISO 20022 pain.001 credit transfer and pain.008 direct
  debit XML. It is held to the pain001 conformance kit shared by every
  pain001 client.
authors:
